 ssing the development of Beacon Hill since the nineteenth century. Mr. Sam
 marco has written over 75 books on the history and development of Boston i
 ncluding Beacon Hill Through Time. Over the years\, Mr. Sammarco taught hi
 story at Boston University and at Urban College of Boston. He has received
  the Bulfinch Award\, the Washington Medal\, and other recognitions for hi
 s works.\nhttps://bpl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a762f87c7e02e3d006e9f1c\nF
